# LICENSE is copied in from the repo root during `bun pm pack` / `npm publish`
# (prepack) and removed by postpack. It is not tracked, so a hard-killed pack
# never leaves a dirty tracked file — the leftover is an inert, git-ignored copy.
# The daemon's own README.md is committed in-package (unlike the cli, which
# copies the root marketing README in at pack time).
/LICENSE
